 "A valid combination would be ",
 StyleBox["{DefineCoupling, Yd, EFTOrder\[Rule] 1}", "SeeAlso"],
 ", which adds/changes the option ",
 StyleBox["EFTOrder\[Rule] 1", "SeeAlso"],
 " to the definition of the coupling ",
 StyleBox["Yd", "SeeAlso"],
 " when loading the model (assuming that the coupling ",
 StyleBox["Yd", "SeeAlso"],
 " is defined in the model).   "
}], "ExampleText",
 CellID->1742978445,ExpressionUUID->"031d2ba2-1fa7-4101-aa71-d71fd64792d3"]
}, Dynamic[CurrentValue[
 EvaluationNotebook[], {TaggingRules, "Openers", "NotesSection"}, Closed]]]],

