  "c9c796ea-76f2-4355-81c9-1da35abe18ca"],
 " is very general and can be used to change ",
 StyleBox["all",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " options for any object defined in the model file. It is not restricted to \
cosmetic changes but can change, e.g., field properties. Say we can make a \
field from the VLF toy model heavy: "
}], "ExampleText",
 CellID->1201126311,ExpressionUUID->"9ad3561a-6cb9-4d38-9ed6-484bd71cfa68"],

